            "description": "Preview a match outcome without recording it (requires recorder role)\n\n`POST /matches/preview` · operationId `previewMatch`\n\nRequires the **recorder** role — run Auth → Log in first.\n\nPass the same optional `sessionId` the match will be recorded with, or the preview ignores repeat-opponent damping."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Record a match result; idempotent on id",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code >= 200 && pm.response.code < 300) {",
                  "  const value = pm.response.json().match.id",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('matchId', value)",
                  "  console.log('matchId =', value)",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"id\": \"{{$guid}}\",\n  \"homePlayerId\": \"{{homePlayerId}}\",\n  \"awayPlayerId\": \"{{awayPlayerId}}\",\n  \"homeScore\": 2,\n  \"awayScore\": 1\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/matches",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "matches"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Record a match result (requires recorder role); idempotent on id\n\n`POST /matches` · operationId `recordMatch`\n\nRequires the **recorder** role — run Auth → Log in first.\n\n`id` is the idempotency key. `{{$guid}}` makes a fresh one on every send, so every send records a NEW match. To retry one submission safely, replace it with a fixed UUID. Add `\"sessionId\"` to attach the match to a session (the web app does this automatically)."
          }
        },
